Problem Statement

Finance, sales, marketing, and supply chain data lived in separate places, with no single view of overall business performance
Checking profit and loss for a specific customer, product, or time period required digging through multiple reports
Sales and marketing teams had no easy way to compare which customers or products were actually profitable
The supply chain team had no clear way to track how accurate their demand forecasts were
Overall, this made it slow and difficult to spot problems or make quick, informed decisions
